  "sourceTitle": "Brown Sauce",
  "sourceText": "Brown Sauce\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Wednesday, December 2, 2009 - 12:32am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/2 cup or less vinegar\n1 cup ketchup\n1 cup water\n3 tablespoons Worcestershire sauce\n4 tablespoons brown sugar\n2 teaspoons salt may omit\n1 teaspoon pepper\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Cook for 45 minutes, stirring frequently. Pour over cooked roast, stew beef, chicken or pork and bake for 30 minutes at 325 degrees. Especially good on beef.",
